            <ArticleTitle>Modifications of composite grafts for coronary bypass surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>196-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We herein describe four modifications of graft construction in coronary bypass surgery, including composite left mammary arterial T graft, arterial-venous I, and U grafts, and coronary-coronary vein graft and discuss their indications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
